  "section": "26",
  "quote": "A landlord may enter a rental unit without written notice to clean it if the tenancy agreement requires the landlord to clean the rental unit at regular intervals and, (a) the landlord enters the unit at the times specified in the tenancy agreement",
  "reason": "Section 26(2)(a) of the Act explicitly allows a landlord to enter a rental unit without written notice to clean it if the tenancy agreement requires the landlord to clean at regular intervals and specifies the times for entry. Because the clause requires cleaning every second Friday and specifies entry between 10 a.m. and 2 p.m., it complies with the Act."
}

